{"id":"n7c1f13ce15","headline":"In Italy, the Price of Fuel Has Decoupled from Oil","summary":"The article examines how far the oil price surge triggered by the war in Iran has affected petroleum products, particularly gasoline, in Italy. Pump prices have moved differently from crude.","why":"Pump prices depend on crude costs, refining margins, taxes and distribution, so they do not always track crude one-for-one.","category":"commodities","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Rome","country":"Italy","lat":41.903,"lon":12.496,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"ilmessaggero.it","url":"https://www.ilmessaggero.it:443/economia/numeri_veri/petrolio_benzina_prezzo-9702825.html"},"sources":[{"name":"ilmessaggero.it","url":"https://www.ilmessaggero.it:443/economia/numeri_veri/petrolio_benzina_prezzo-9702825.html"}],"published_at":"2026-08-11T22:10:40Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"6c2d5ac305967907","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-11T22:10:40Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-12T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"In Italia il prezzo del pieno disallineato dal petrolio","source_language":"ita","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-7026489.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"yamabon","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/factory-industrial-production-7026489/"}}